From deb4864b80324855090af56817b1783dab1303f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Jul 2026 11:44:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Video Studio: AI text/image-to-video, photo slideshows,
 Google Drive import

- New video_generations job table + video_gen_settings (provider selection),
  run as in-process background jobs with polling endpoints
- Switchable AI video providers (Replicate: WAN 2.2 fast defaults; admin can
  override models and store keys encrypted), mirroring the imageGen registry
- Deterministic ffmpeg slideshow engine (crossfades, caption overlay, music)
- Google Drive photo import (drive.readonly OAuth, folder browser, import to
  workspace storage), reusing the YouTube Google client
- Funding: new 'video' quota + credit kind wired through plans, usage,
  credit packs, purchases, webhook backstop, and ledger
- Content items carry videoPath/videoThumbnailPath; save-to-library creates
  draft reels; library renders video players
- videoGen feature kill switch; superadmin video-gen settings + key routes
- Web: /video-studio page (three engines, library + Drive pickers, job
  progress, preview, save-to-library), nav entry, feature gate
- Contract-first: openapi.yaml + regenerated orval clients (drift-clean)
- Tests: real-ffmpeg slideshow encode, videos route funding/tenancy, web page

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EJdoZ8bk1pWTrmbMVQJZ7G
